        <rule name="Dreadnought Twin Linked" id="167a-1af2-c4b6-961f" hidden="false" page="55" publicationId="4590-6ba9-5482-a1fa">
          <description>When you hit a vehicle, you may +1 or -1 from the hit location roll. Cannot be used to hit a location blocked by cover. Once the hit location has been determined make a separate armour pen roll for each lascannon</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Havoc Missile Launcher" id="db33-9550-4ea2-e4a2" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Havoc Missile Launcher" id="4730-5ec8-4565-f09f" hidden="false" page="42" publicationId="06e5-8e36-e8c8-aec3" typeId="d8e8-6c66-f558-30ee" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Short range" typeId="a108-ac67-8c42-6bbb">20</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Long Range" typeId="3acf-5fa0-de29-6094">72</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Short &apos;To Hit’" typeId="bbc0-6de5-4dfa-9328"/>
            <characteristic name="Long &apos;To Hit’" typeId="10bb-0500-b03c-643c"/>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="e297-34fa-4b72-f0b6"/>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="8978-f9c3-8957-1481">As Missile</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save Modifier" typeId="53ec-cd58-3d6e-c00d"/>
            <characteristic name="Armour Penetration" typeId="0530-f4b7-b7db-de67"/>
            <characteristic name="Special" typeId="9fb9-b2be-dfa5-713d">Move or Fire, Havoc Missile Launcher</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Frag Missile" id="13a7-d65f-ed64-0e07" hidden="false" page="43" publicationId="06e5-8e36-e8c8-aec3" typeId="4fd7-adb4-cddd-0136" typeName="Weapon - Missile / Grenade">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="51dd-04c1-d98c-138d">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="1028-07d4-bd9d-15d3">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save Modifier" typeId="572d-e3e8-a08a-5603">-1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Blast Area" typeId="c090-9b36-533a-a5a0">2&quot; radius</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special" typeId="0193-4cf7-077c-97ba"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Havoc Missile Launcher" id="0589-9de4-792b-6f04" hidden="false" page="78" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5">
          <description>May fire in the shooting phase in addition to normal firing. Has 9 frag missiles you must track during the game. Can fire any amount of missiles during your turn (including all of them at once). Once all missiles fired, cannot use again. When under Stupidity, must fire all remaining missiles.
Roll to hit with first missile as normal. The rest of the missiles scatter from the point of the first using Artillery dice and the Scatter dice. If you roll a misfire and an arrow on the Scatter, the shot is a dud. If any of the missiles roll a hit and a misfire result together it explodes in the launcher rack. It will destroy the weapon and any remaining missiles. No damage to the dreadnought, but any troops within 2&quot; of the centre of the Dreadnought will suffer a S4 hit with -1 save modifier
The launcher cannot be hit separetely but any hit which penetrates the body will cripple the Havoc launcher too</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Assault Launchers" id="d6b1-e397-701f-2441" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Assault Launchers" id="6505-c408-8ba1-5853" hidden="false" typeId="4fd7-adb4-cddd-0136" typeName="Weapon - Missile / Grenade">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="51dd-04c1-d98c-138d">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="1028-07d4-bd9d-15d3">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save Modifier" typeId="572d-e3e8-a08a-5603">-1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Blast Area" typeId="c090-9b36-533a-a5a0">2&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special" typeId="0193-4cf7-077c-97ba">Assault Launchers</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Assault Launchers" id="5393-2062-50aa-5d90" hidden="false" page="79" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5">
          <description>3 grenades total, which are all fired together when used and then the weapon is out of ammo. 2 launchers, with 1 on each shoulder. Cannot be used with Havoc launcher. Can choose to use 1 or both of the launchers in the shooting phase in addition to its normal firing. The first Frag grenade in the spread automatically hits a point exactly 6&quot; in a straight line from the launcher. The other two grenades deviate D3&quot; away from the target point of the first grenade, using the same weapon profile. Any hit which penetrates the body of the dreadnought will cripple its Assault launchers as well</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
