      <rules>
        <rule name="Defiler Rules" id="d8b2-80a5-2710-2f2e" hidden="false">
          <description>+1 to Hit for all shots fired at it, due to being so alrge.
Extra attack dice and +1 WS for additional attackers in close combat do not apply against a Defiler. May never be pinned unless engaged by an equally large opponent (other titan). 
May move in all directions without turning. May turn like a regular Walker if it wishes. Will gain +1 attack for each additional close combat weapon added.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
