                <infoLink name="Immune to Psychology" id="003a-466c-2e4c-f11f" hidden="false" targetId="2e73-71d0-e4b8-58e1" type="rule"/>
              </infoLinks>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="N&apos;Kari" id="3ffd-7013-013f-b606" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="219f-0faa-a2d8-f766" typeName="Unit">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="49de-956f-8797-7436">N&apos;kari</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="M" typeId="4934-7872-3dd7-a8b6">6</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="WS" typeId="dc18-b600-96a9-a4a3">10</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="BS" typeId="f859-88a3-fdd3-b298">10</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="S" typeId="5916-04ef-0fd1-6557">7</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="T" typeId="2e7d-2383-f92f-16f9">7</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="W" typeId="ce31-f767-c572-72cc">9</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="I" typeId="a9b1-bae9-25d0-fdbf">8</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="A" typeId="e39a-b0ee-e6d1-e661">7</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="LD" typeId="c751-ec1f-edb8-fd83">11</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Aura of Slaanesh" id="3a7d-ebde-2bb0-5aa5" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">In close combat, enemy models must test against their Leadership on 3D6 to be able to strike N&apos;Kari. If they fail, they fight normally but if they win the combat they will not strike the model so any hits are wasted and the combat is a draw. If they pass they do not have to pass again</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Mark of Slaanesh" id="3958-5d2c-fbfe-d839" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Immune to all psychology tests. Never needs to take a Break test. If N&apos;Kari is with a unit that is forced to flee then he is not affected and can continue to fight as normal</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Doombolt" id="675f-9245-12f0-3e1f" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="11a6-8e13-a1ad-7e34" typeName="Unit Psychic Powers">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Name" typeId="f6df-d058-1a8b-c2f7">Doombolt</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Cast on" typeId="f4e5-8437-16be-8b1f">Automatically, but may be nullified</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Special" typeId="8ec1-f69b-9d13-1fff">Strike first model in it&apos;s path, up to 18&quot; away. Target suffers D6 S5 hits with a -2 save. Vehicles or buildings take a singlt hit with an armour penetration of D6x5</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Rod of Command" id="f3c7-5257-fa92-8c99" hidden="false" page="140" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Once per battle may be used to command a friendly unit anywhere on the table to move twice in a single turn. The affected unit moves and then immediately has another movement phase. In addition, any friendly units within 24&quot; of N&apos;Kari may make Leadership tests using N&apos;Kari&apos;s Leadership of 11</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry name="Army Commander" id="f092-5b06-305e-2de2" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
