              <profiles>
                <profile name="Allure of Slaanesh" id="f910-423a-57df-3e1c" hidden="false" page="69" typeId="aa04-135c-b9c2-b9e7" typeName="Chaos Rewards">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Gift" typeId="7669-0cd9-797f-2e6d">In close combat, enemy models must test against their Leadership on 3D6 to be able to strike this model. If they fail the test then they fight normally, but if they win the combat they will not strike the model and so any hits are wasted and combat is a draw. Once an enemy model has passed the test, it neeed not test again.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
