                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Gift" typeId="7669-0cd9-797f-2e6d">May use a nullify each psychic phase just as if they had been dealt a Nullify card. This always works on a 4+ no matter what the psychic levels of the models involved</characteristic>
